{"id":"n72119-1-8","stage":1,"title":"청년 · 青年","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72119-1-8-1","ko":"이 잘생긴 청년은 대체 누군가?","zh":"这个帅气的年轻人到底是谁啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"잘생긴","meaning":"好看，漂亮，英俊","explanation":"잘생기다：好看，漂亮，英俊；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"잘생기다","audio":"/audio/c56f4bd1fb4139c5b3d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24881","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘생긴","audio":"/audio/15f5844c6315584d9ab8.mp3"}},{"text":"청년은","meaning":"青年","explanation":"청년：青年；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"청년","audio":"/audio/2ba964fa5267e717fa2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72119","senseId":"1","lemma":"청년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"청년은","audio":"/audio/2cadd4427141ad3ea6e4.mp3"}},{"text":"대체","meaning":"到底、究竟","explanation":"대체：到底、究竟。","readings":[{"term":"대체","audio":"/audio/baa66ff689021a3fd29e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:대체:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"대체","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대체","audio":"/audio/baa66ff689021a3fd29e.mp3"}},{"text":"누군가?","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누군가","audio":"/audio/09cdd1dd218a0acf72bd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"c56